   "sender_id": "contact_97d96f0ae605829fbdfbf3f4",
   "text": "Hi Ray! Yes, all four are still here. They're the tan ones with the ties on the back, and they only spent one summer on a covered patio, so there's no fading. I have them at 45 for the set. Did you want all four?",
