   "sender_id": "contact_624483321982237cde191eea",
   "text": "Hello Mr. Castillo, I am very sorry to see your chair. Yes, ours are the same stacking style with arms, in white. They have always been kept under the patio cover, and they are perfect, with no cracks and no chalky spots. My son is visiting on Saturday, so I will have him carry them out into the light and take more pictures for you this weekend. Kind regards, Luz Mendoza",
