   "sender_id": "contact_889dd1f80a52b030d9d19a47",
   "text": "Hey Ray, of course! His number is on a card on my fridge, I'll bring it by. He fixed the latch on my side gate last spring and patched the stucco by my back door, and he charged me fair. Tell him Gloria sent you.",
